+This method generates an isosurface from 3D scalar field data by applying a modified Marching Cubes algorithm that resolves topological ambiguities, followed by a triangle decimation step to reduce mesh complexity. It distinguishes itself from standard Marching Cubes by explicitly removing ambiguous cases and collapsing degenerate triangles to improve visual quality and storage efficiency [S1, unofficial].
 
